 &lt;blockquote&gt;
 &lt;p&gt;Recently started learning &lt;code&gt;Java&lt;/code&gt; and using the classic &lt;code&gt;Eclipse IDE&lt;/code&gt;, but found the download speed too slow&amp;hellip;&lt;/p&gt;

 &lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;h1 id="problem-analysis"&gt;Problem Analysis
&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="432px" data-flex-grow="180" height="789" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://goodcoder666.github.io/p/eclipseinstmirrors/1.png" srcset="https://goodcoder666.github.io/p/eclipseinstmirrors/1_hu_2dbfcdd39bb8b488.png 800w, https://goodcoder666.github.io/p/eclipseinstmirrors/1.png 1422w" width="1422"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;Eclipse&lt;/code&gt; downloads rely on third-party mirrors, which (on my machine) default to a North Korean mirror (defaults may vary across devices):&lt;br&gt;
&lt;img class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="432px" data-flex-grow="180" height="789" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://goodcoder666.github.io/p/eclipseinstmirrors/2.png" srcset="https://goodcoder666.github.io/p/eclipseinstmirrors/2_hu_586c3f8fd9954885.png 800w, https://goodcoder666.github.io/p/eclipseinstmirrors/2.png 1422w" width="1422"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Click &lt;code&gt;Select Another Mirror&lt;/code&gt;:&lt;br&gt;
&lt;img class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="432px" data-flex-grow="180" height="789" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://goodcoder666.github.io/p/eclipseinstmirrors/3.png" srcset="https://goodcoder666.github.io/p/eclipseinstmirrors/3_hu_ebd79975ba0be59e.png 800w, https://goodcoder666.github.io/p/eclipseinstmirrors/3.png 1422w" width="1422"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Select a Chinese mirror:&lt;br&gt;
&lt;img alt="Solution" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="311px" data-flex-grow="129" height="592" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://goodcoder666.github.io/p/eclipseinstmirrors/4.png" width="768"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Eclipse Check For Updates Always Fails to Find Updates - Solution</title><link>https://goodcoder666.github.io/en/p/eclipseupdmirror/</link><pubDate>Wed, 08 Apr 2020 22:12:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://goodcoder666.github.io/en/p/eclipseupdmirror/</guid><description>
 &lt;blockquote&gt;
 &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Translation Notice&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;
This article was machine-translated using DeepSeek-R1.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Original Version&lt;/strong&gt;: Authored in Chinese by myself&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accuracy Advisory&lt;/strong&gt;: Potential discrepancies may exist between translations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Precedence&lt;/strong&gt;: The Chinese text shall prevail in case of ambiguity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Feedback&lt;/strong&gt;: Technical suggestions regarding translation quality are welcomed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

 &lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Recently tried to update &lt;code&gt;Eclipse&lt;/code&gt; using the &lt;code&gt;Help -&amp;gt; Check For Updates&lt;/code&gt; feature in this popular &lt;code&gt;Java IDE&lt;/code&gt;, but it always reports no updates found:&lt;br&gt;
&lt;img alt="No Updates Found illustration" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="812px" data-flex-grow="338" height="153" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://goodcoder666.github.io/p/eclipseupdmirror/1.png" width="518"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1 id="check-for-available-updates"&gt;Check for Available Updates
&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;First, visit the &lt;a class="link" href="https://www.eclipse.org/eclipseide/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
 &gt;Eclipse Download Page&lt;/a&gt; to get the latest version (currently 2020-06):&lt;br&gt;
&lt;img alt="2020-06" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="347px" data-flex-grow="144" height="823" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://goodcoder666.github.io/p/eclipseupdmirror/2.png" srcset="https://goodcoder666.github.io/p/eclipseupdmirror/2_hu_c0fa778fdc8771ee.png 800w, https://goodcoder666.github.io/p/eclipseupdmirror/2.png 1191w" width="1191"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Then check your local Eclipse version (&lt;code&gt;Help -&amp;gt; About Eclipse IDE&lt;/code&gt;):&lt;br&gt;
&lt;img alt="Go to Help" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="194px" data-flex-grow="80" height="410" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://goodcoder666.github.io/p/eclipseupdmirror/3.png" width="332"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="version" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="373px" data-flex-grow="155" height="450" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://goodcoder666.github.io/p/eclipseupdmirror/4.png" width="701"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If the online version matches your current version (as shown), then &lt;code&gt;System.exit(0);&lt;/code&gt;&amp;hellip; Don&amp;rsquo;t blame Eclipse unnecessarily&amp;hellip;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1 id="fix-detection-failure-when-updates-exist"&gt;Fix Detection Failure When Updates Exist
&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;Open the &amp;ldquo;Available Software Sites&amp;rdquo; window:&lt;br&gt;
&lt;img class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="336px" data-flex-grow="140" height="555" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://goodcoder666.github.io/p/eclipseupdmirror/5.png" width="777"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Method 1: Click the &amp;ldquo;available software sites&amp;rdquo; link in the prompt window:&lt;br&gt;
&lt;img class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="812px" data-flex-grow="338" height="153" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://goodcoder666.github.io/p/eclipseupdmirror/6.png" width="518"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Method 2: Navigate to &lt;code&gt;Window -&amp;gt; Prefrences -&amp;gt; Install/Update -&amp;gt; available software sites&lt;/code&gt;:&lt;br&gt;
&lt;img class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="200px" data-flex-grow="83" height="199" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://goodcoder666.github.io/p/eclipseupdmirror/7.png" width="166"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Locate &lt;code&gt;Latest Eclipse Release&lt;/code&gt;, check the red-dotted entry, click &lt;code&gt;Apply and Close&lt;/code&gt;, then recheck updates.&lt;br&gt;
&lt;img class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="375px" data-flex-grow="156" height="555" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://goodcoder666.github.io/p/eclipseupdmirror/8.png" srcset="https://goodcoder666.github.io/p/eclipseupdmirror/8_hu_74d7aa08417f93c5.png 800w, https://goodcoder666.github.io/p/eclipseupdmirror/8.png 869w" width="869"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>